    "https://nsucareers.nova.edu/jobs/adjunct-faculty-psychology-fort-lauderdale-davie-florida-united-states-7e120daf-68c7-4422-952a-8a9cccc11de5": {
      "title": "Adjunct Faculty, Psychology",
      "description": "Adjunct Faculty, Psychology - Fort Lauderdale-Davie, Florida, United States Home Search Jobs All Jobs Staff Jobs Faculty Jobs Temporary Jobs Featured Jobs Benefits NSU Culture NSU at a Glance Faculty and Staff News NSU in the News NSU Research NSU Mako Magazine Winter 2025 My Profile Kiosk mode Adjunct Faculty, Psychology College of Psychology Ready to Apply? Adjunct Faculty, Psychology 508438 3300 S University Drive, Fort Lauderdale-Davie, Florida, United States, 33328 Faculty - Arts, Humanities, Social Sciences, Psychology, Education Adjunct Faculty Closing on: Jan 29 2027 College of Psychology Add to favorites View favorites We are excited that you are considering joining Nova Southeastern University! Nova Southeastern University (NSU) was founded in 1964, and is a not-for-profit, independent university with a reputation for academic excellence and innovation. Nova Southeastern University offers competitive salaries, a comprehensive benefits package including tuition waiver, retirement plan, excellent medical and dental plans and much more. NSU cares about the health and welfare of its students, faculty, staff, and campus visitors and is a tobacco-free university. We appreciate your support in making NSU the preeminent place to live, work, study and grow. Thank you for your interest in a career with Nova Southeastern University. Primary Purpose: The College of Psychology at Nova Southeastern University is seeking adjunct faculty to teach courses in Doctoral, Specialist, Master's, and/or Bachelor's programs in psychology. Locations: Fort Lauderdale and online. Job Category: Exempt Hiring Range: Commensurate with Experience Pay Basis: Subject to Grant Funding? Essential Job Functions: Teach courses in one or more of the following programs: 1. Doctoral clinical psychology program - Doctorate in clinical psychology or related field required. 2. School psychology program - Doctorate in school psychology or related field with licensure as a psychologist/school psychologist and/or certification as a school psychologist required. 3. Master's programs in experimental, general, and forensic psychology - Doctorate in psychology or related field required. 4. Undergraduate psychology program - Master's degree in psychology or related field required. A doctoral degree is preferred. Job Requirements: Required Knowledge, Skills, & Abilities: Required Certifications/Licensures: Required Education: Master's Degree or Doctorate Degree Major (if required: Required Experience: Teaching experience is preferred for the Undergraduate and Master's in Psychology programs but required for the Clinical & School Psychology programs. Applicants should submit a letter of interest, a curriculum vitae, and a letter of recommendation. Preferred Qualifications: Is this a safety sensitive position? No Background Screening Required? No Pre-Employment Conditions: Sensitivity Disclaimer: Nova Southeastern University is in full compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and does not discriminate with regard to applicants or employees with disabilities and will make reasonable accommodation when necessary. NSU is an Equal Opportunity Employer and considers applicants for all positions without regard to race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, age, disability, marital or veteran status or any other legally protected status. People Also Viewed TEMPORARY- Administrative Coordinator I Fort Lauderdale-Davie HPD-OSTEOPATHIC MEDICINE-DAVIE Teacher - (Gr K-5) - 997488 Fort Lauderdale-Davie US-DAVIE LOWER TEMPORARY Administrative Coordinator I Fort Lauderdale-Davie HPD-OSTEOPATHIC MEDICINE-DAVIE Want to be notified when we post new jobs?  Sign up here! Job Alert 59db09eb Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Faculty - Ar