ties: Required Certifications/Licensures: Required Education: Doctoral Degree or Master's Degree Major (if required: Neuroscience or related field Required Experience: Teaching experience is preferred. Applicants should submit a letter of interest, a curriculum vitae, and a letter of recommendation. Preferred Qualifications: Is this a safety sensitive position? No Background Screening Required? No Pre-Employment Conditions: Sensitivity Disclaimer: Nova Southeastern University is in full compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA) and does not discriminate with regard to applicants or employees with disabilities and will make reasonable accommodation when necessary. NSU is an Equal Opportunity Employer and considers applicants for all positions without regard to race, color, religion, creed, gender, national origin, age, disability, marital or veteran status or any other legally protected status. People Also Viewed TEMPORARY- Administrative Coordinator I Fort Lauderdale-Davie HPD-OSTEOPATHIC MEDICINE-DAVIE Teacher - (Gr K-5) - 997488 Fort Lauderdale-Davie US-DAVIE LOWER TEMPORARY Administrative Coordinator I Fort Lauderdale-Davie HPD-OSTEOPATHIC MEDICINE-DAVIE Want to be notified when we post new jobs?  Sign up here! Job Alert d5d33201 Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Categories Faculty - Arts, Humanities, Social Sciences, Psychology, Education Faculty - Arts, Humanities, Social Sciences, Psychology, Education Locations Fort Lauderdale-Davie, Florida, United States Fort Lauderdale-Davie, Florida, United States First Name (required) 046aae78 Last Name (required) 41d90c25 Email (required) d5e50881 Send Please wait... Done Not You? By submitting this form, you consent to receive text messages related to available jobs and information about working at NSU.  Mes